<title>MALAYSIA: Metacorp stock suspended for news.</title>
<headline>Metacorp stock suspended for news.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Metacorp Bhd were suspended on Wednesday for a company announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the toll plaza operator and property developer were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Shares of Metacorp closed at 7.35 ringgit on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
